            "answer": "<p>Both finishes are on the same 2205 marine-grade stainless steel, so both carry the 10-year no-rust promise. Pick by look: Brushed Stainless disappears against the water, and Matte Black reads as a thin dark line against white trim. Rinse either one with fresh water when you wash the windows. The sample kit lets you see both next to your siding.</p>",
