            "text": "<p>Many ocean-front homes on the Balboa Peninsula and in West Newport end in a roof deck. The California code asks for a 42\" guard there like any other deck. Top-mount spigots on the slab or on blocked wood framing carry 48\" panels; the engineering documents show the blocking.</p>"
